Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:35.10,Note,,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:41.30,Note,,0,0,0,,(密苏里州 圣路易市)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:21.00,Note,,0,0,0,,(一个星期前)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.41,0:00:04.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Previously on Supernatural
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:05.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.83,0:00:07.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赶快带你弟弟离开屋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take your brother outside as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.77,0:00:09.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 迪恩 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, Dean. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:13.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸已经踏上了捕猎之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad's on a hunting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:15.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他好几天没回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:18.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发过誓再也不猎魔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l swore I was done hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:20.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一个人没法完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.14,0:00:22.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 杰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! Jess!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:24.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他想让我们继续他的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think Dad wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:27.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是 救助他人 猎杀恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, saving people, hunting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:29.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我得找出杀杰西卡的凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. I gotta find Jessica's killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:51.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:33.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家注意 我们找到受害人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Be advised, we found the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.59,0:01:37.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.43,0:01:42.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事了 没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:47.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在里面 在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In there.In there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:50.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Choke Team let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.53,0:01:58.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}站住 别动 扔了那把刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Freeze! Don't move!Drop the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:00.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把头抬起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep your hands where I see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:01.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}扔了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:03.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 转过来 - 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hold it right there! - Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.90,0:02:04.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:06.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}慢慢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.75,0:02:09.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}按我说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.89,0:02:33.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我想我们能在午饭前到达图凯瑞然后向南开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. l figure we hit Tucumcari by lunch, then head south...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:36.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺利的话半夜就能到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}bisbee...then Bisbee by midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:39.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么时候变得跟个女人一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam wears women's underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.18,0:02:42.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我在听 我只是很忙 - 忙着做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- l've been listening, l'm just busy. - Busy doing what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:44.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}读我的邮件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Reading e-mails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:48.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 谁发给你的邮件 - 我斯坦福的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- E-mails from who? - From my friends at Stanford.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.41,0:02:51.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在说笑吧 你还在和你的大学同学联系吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're kidding. You still keep in touch with your college buddies?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:54.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 为什么不 - 那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Why not? - Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:02:59.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和他们说过你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what exactly do you tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:02.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于你要去那里 你在做过什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know? About where you've been, what you've been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.01,0:03:05.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉他们我正和我哥一起汽车旅行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I tell them l'm on a road trip with my big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:08.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是告诉他们我需要时间安抚自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I tell them l needed some time off after Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:09.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么你对他们撒谎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, so you lie to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:13.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我只是没告诉他们全部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. I just don't tell them everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:16.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那就叫撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, that's called lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:18.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兄弟 这我能理解 告诉他们真相是不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I get it. Telling them the truth is far worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.99,0:03:21.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我该做什么 把我的朋友都吓跑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, what am l supposed to do? Just cut everybody out of my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:25.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你认真的吗 - 听着 这的确很糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You're serious? - Look, it sucks, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.53,0:03:27.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但做这样的工作 你不可能和普通人很亲近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a job like this, you can't get close to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:30.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你自己不擅社交 你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're kind of antisocial, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:31.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 随你怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:38.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 天啊 - 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- God. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.05,0:03:42.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我朋友瑞贝卡·沃伦发来的邮件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This e-mail from this girl Rebecca Warren, one of those friends of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:44.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她漂亮吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:46.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和她还有她哥扎克是同学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I went to school with her and her brother Zach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:49.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说扎克因为谋杀罪正被控告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She says Zach's been charged with murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:51.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为杀害他女朋友而被捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Arrested for killing his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:53.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑞贝卡说她哥哥没做过 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rebecca says he didn't do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.56,0:03:57.19,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但看来警察有着比较充足的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but it sounds like the cops have a pretty good case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兄弟 你到底和什么样的家伙混在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dude, what kind of people you hanging out with?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.78,0:04:01.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我了解扎克 他绝不会杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I know Zach. He's no killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.93,0:04:04.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你像他一样 都有所隐瞒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, well, maybe you know Zach as well as he knows you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.95,0:04:07.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们在圣路易市 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're in St.Louis. We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.78,0:04:09.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为你的朋友感到难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, sorry about your buddy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.87,0:04:12.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这不是我们该解决的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This does not sound like our kind of problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:13.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我们的问题 他们是我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is. They're my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:17.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣路易市在我们身后400公里 Sam\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}St.Louis is 400 miles behind us, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.18,0:04:35.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我的天啊 萨姆 - 这不是小贝基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Oh, my God. Sam. - Well, if it isn't little Becky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:38.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 你喜欢叫什么就叫什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you know what you can do with that "little Becky" crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:44.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我收到你的邮件了 - 我没想到你会来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- l got your e-mail. - l didn't think that you would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:47.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是迪恩 他哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean. Older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.32,0:04:48.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你好 - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:52.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是来帮忙的 看看我们能做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're here to help.Whatever we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:53.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:04:59.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}房间很漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nice place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:00.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我父母的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's my parents'.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:04.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去我只是周末才来这里渡假的 但当这事情发生后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was crashing here for the long weekend when everything happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:08.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我决定这学期休学 等扎克没事之后我看离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I decided to take the semester off. I'm gonna stay until Zach's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.01,0:05:12.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那你的亲人呢 - 他们在巴黎住了半年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Where are your folks? - They live in Paris for half the year...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:14.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在他们为了审讯正赶来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so they're on their way home now for the trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:16.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们要点啤酒或其它什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You guys want a beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.08,0:05:17.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 谢了 - 不用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hey. - No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.65,0:05:22.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我们到底发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So tell us what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:27.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 扎克回到家 他发现艾米丽被绑在椅子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well... Zach, he came home, and he found Emily tied to a chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.99,0:05:32.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她被人殴打过 鲜血淋淋 已经没有呼吸 所以他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And she was beaten up and bloody, and she wasn't breathing, and so he
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:37.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他打911 警察赶来了 可是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He called 911 and the police, they showed up and-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:38.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们逮捕了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And they arrested him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:42.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但实际是 如果是扎克杀害了艾米丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the thing is, the only way that Zach could have killed Emily...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:45.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么只能说明他能够同时身处两地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is if he was in two places at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:47.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察有一盘录象带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The police, they have a video.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.90,0:05:51.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是从十字路口录象里头剪辑下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lt's from the security tape from across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.01,0:05:55.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上面记录显示扎克十点半回了家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it shows Zach coming home at 10:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:57.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾米丽就在那后被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, Emily was killed just after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.14,0:06:02.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我可以发誓他那时正和我一起 喝啤酒直到半夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But l swear, he was here with me having a few beers until at least after midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:05.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以去看看扎克家的犯罪现场吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, maybe we could see the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:07.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 扎克的家 - 可以吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Zach's house. - We could.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:11.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样你们能做些什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, why?I mean, what could you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:14.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不行 但迪恩是警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, me, not much. But Dean's a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:22.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 实际上我是侦探 - 真的吗 哪里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- A detective, actually. - Really? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:24.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亚利桑那州 比斯比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bisbee, Arizona.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:27.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我现在在休假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But l'm off duty now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:33.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白为什么你们对我那么好 我真的不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You guys, it's so nice to offer, but I just-l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:37.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝克 听着 我知道扎克没杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Beck, look, l know Zach didn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.77,0:06:42.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我们得证明他无罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, we have to find a way to prove that he's innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:45.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:48.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去拿钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm gonna go get the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:57.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兄弟 看来你对你的朋友很坦白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're a real straight shooter with your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:07:00.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 扎克和贝基 需要我们的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, Zach and Becky need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:01.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我认为这不是我们该处理的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l don't think this is our kind of problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:04.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说一个人同时出现在两地吗 那我们就查到底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two places at once?We've looked into less.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:26.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们觉得这么做合适吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're sure this is okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:29.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没问题 我是执法者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. l am an officer of the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.88,0:07:48.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝基 你想呆在外面吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Beck, you wanna wait outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:52.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我想帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I wanna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:02.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我们警察还说了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell us what else the police said.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:06.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 没有闯入的迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, there's no sign of a break-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:08.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说是艾米丽让凶手进门的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They say that Emily let her attacker in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:12.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}律师们也都在考虑怎么样减少刑罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The lawyers, they're already talking about plea-bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:16.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.95,0:08:23.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 贝基 如果扎克没那么做 那就是其他人干的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, Beck, if Zach didn't do this, it means someone else did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:25.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能想起是谁吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any idea who?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:34.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对了 这有些事情 大概一星期前 有人破门而入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was something. About a week before, somebody broke in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:38.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偷了些扎克的衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They stole some clothes. Zach's clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:41.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是警察他们把这不当回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The police, they don't think it's anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.47,0:08:44.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的意思是我们离市中心没那么远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, we're not that far from downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.64,0:08:47.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时候会遭到抢劫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sometimes people get robbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.66,0:08:57.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗 这狗以前很温顺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, that used to be the sweetest dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:08:58.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:00.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He just changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.43,0:09:02.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还记得它什么时候开始变的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you remember when he changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:05.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在凶案发生那个时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I guess around the time of the murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:18.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}扎克女朋友被杀时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So the neighbor's dog went psycho...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:20.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邻居家的狗像疯了似地乱叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}right around the time Zach's girlfriend was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:23.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}动物通常对超自然现象很敏感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Animals can sense the paranormal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:25.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许它是看到了些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, maybe Fido saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:29.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你现在觉得是我们的问题了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you think maybe this is our kind of problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:31.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这还不能确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.70,0:09:34.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们得看看录象带确定一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we should look at the security tape just to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:36.28,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 - 恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:40.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个录象呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So the tape, the security footage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:44.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你的律师能弄到它 我没那权限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Think your lawyers could get it?I don't have that jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.29,0:09:48.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有带子 我不想在警察前说错什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've already got it. l didn't wanna say something in front of the cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:53.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从律师的桌上偷到了 我只想自己看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stole it off the lawyer's desk.I just had to see it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:56.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:16.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会想你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:20.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他们为什么要送你去呢 - 因为我是最棒的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Why do they always have to send you? - Because I'm the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:23.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 所以我想你留在家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, l know. That's why I want you to stay home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:25.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是去一趟堪萨斯城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just Kansas City.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.50,0:10:31.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明晚就回来 回来弥补你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Be home tomorrow night and make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:36.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最好是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'd better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.36,0:11:02.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:06.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}22点04分 这刚过十点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}22:04, that's just after 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:09.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说了死亡时间大概是在十点半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You said time of death was about 10:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.16,0:11:11.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的律师找了几个视频专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our lawyers hired some kind of video expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:13.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说录象带没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He says the tape's authentic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:15.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有做手脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It wasn't tampered with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:23.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝克 我们能喝点啤酒吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Beck, can we take those beers now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:25.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喔 当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.93,0:11:28.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 也拿点三明治 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey... Maybe some sandwiches too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:32.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当这里是什么地方啊 餐厅吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you think this is, Hooters?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:37.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你看到了什么吗 - 来看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- l wish. What is it? - Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:46.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许只是摄影机的反光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe it's just a camera flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.90,0:11:48.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可不象我看过的摄影机的反光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's not like any flare l've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:52.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}许多文明都认为照相能捕捉到灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A lot of cultures believe a photo can catch a glimpse of the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.29,0:11:54.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还记得那条发狂的狗吗 也许它就是看到了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remember that dog? Maybe he saw this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:58.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这是另外一个邪恶的扎克 只是外表和他一样而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe this is a dark double of Zach's, something that looks like him but isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.13,0:12:00.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 就象死灵 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Like a doppelgnger. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:03.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这能解释他为什么同时出现在两地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That would sure explain how he was in two places at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:14.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Honey? It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:19.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}客户最后一刻取消了会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The client cancelled at the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.57,0:12:24.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打电话了 你怎么不接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I called. Why didn't you answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.95,0:12:32.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琳赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lindsay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:34.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琳赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lindsay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.70,0:12:39.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琳赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lindsay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:46.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事的 琳赛 我回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's okay, Lindsay. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.76,0:12:51.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求你了不要再伤害我 放过我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please don't hurt me anymore. Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.74,0:13:55.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 才五点半 我们来这儿干吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. So, what are we doing here at 5:30 in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.16,0:13:56.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发现一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:13:59.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据录像带显示 凶手进去后却没出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The videotape shows the killer going in, but not coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:02.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 所以他是从后门出来的 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- So he came out the back door? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.75,0:14:06.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定有轨迹可以跟踪 警察根本不会追查的轨迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So there should be a trail to follow.A trail the police would never pursue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:10.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他们以为凶手没离开 他们在里面抓到了你的朋友Zach\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because they think the killer never left. They caught your friend Zach inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:14.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还是不明白我们五点半在这儿干吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I still don't know what we're doing here at 5:30 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:30.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}血迹 凶手有经过这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Blood. Somebody came this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:33.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就那点儿痕迹吧 我这边什么也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe the trail ends.i don't see anything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.79,0:14:54.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 发生了什么 - 他企图杀害他的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What happened? - He tried to kill his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:14:58.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 把她绑起来殴打她 - 真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Tied her up and beat her. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.27,0:15:01.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我经常看到他早上去工作 和他的妻子道别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I used to see him going to work in the morning. He'd wave, say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.31,0:15:03.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他看起来是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He seemed like such a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.01,0:15:33.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 还记得我说过这不是我们的问题吗 - 记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hey. Remember when l said this wasn't our kind of problem? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:35.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 可现在一定是我们的事了 - 你查到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Definitely our kind of problem. - What did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.01,0:15:39.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我问了到现场的第一个警察 他也听了Alex的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just talked to the patrolman who heard this guy Alex's story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:41.19,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很明显这个家伙出公差后正开车回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The dude was driving home
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.19,0:15:42.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而当时他老婆正被人袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from a trip when his wife was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:44.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他同时在两地 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- So he was two places at once? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:47.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后别人看到他在自己家里 警察认为他胡说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then he sees himself in the house.Cops say he's a nut job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.98,0:15:52.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两起同样手法袭击自己爱人的案件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two dark doubles attacking loved ones in exactly the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.95,0:15:54.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也应该是同一人做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Could be the same thing doing it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:15:59.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}变形人 某种能把自己变成其它人的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shapeshifter? Something that can make itself look like anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:01.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界上的每种文明都有着变形者的传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every culture has a shapeshifter lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:05.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}传说中的生物能把自己变成动物或人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Legends of creatures who transform themselves into animals or other men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.71,0:16:07.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 幻兽人 狼人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right. Skinwalkers, werewolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:09.24,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同一街区的两起袭击事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We got two attacks within blocks of each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.28,0:16:12.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想这里有个变形者要对付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm guessing we got a shapeshifter problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.51,0:16:13.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我提个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me ask you this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:17.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些传说中的变形人他们会飞吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In all this shapeshifter lore, can any of them fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:21.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我所知没有 我在这里发现了些痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not that I know of.l picked up a trail here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:24.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人从这栋楼的后面溜了出来从这条路跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Someone ran out of the back of this building, headed off this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.53,0:16:28.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 就象你朋友的家一样 - 是的 就象扎克的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Just like your friend's house. - Yeah. And just like at Zach's house...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:30.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但痕迹突然消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the trail suddenly ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.83,0:16:35.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎样它就是消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, whatever it is just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.13,0:16:38.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能有条其它的路可以溜掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, there's another way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.93,0:16:40.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}往地下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:03.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打赌这也通向扎克的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I bet this runs right by Zach's house too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.03,0:17:06.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个变形者能利用下水道系统到这周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The shapeshifter could be using the sewer system to get around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:08.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:11.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.13,0:17:20.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 这是受害者身上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this from his victims?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.83,0:17:27.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚有个恶心的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just had a sick thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:30.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当那个变形者变身的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When the shapeshifter changes shape,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.93,0:17:32.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这就是它脱落的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}maybe it sheds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.33,0:17:36.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那太恶心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.13,0:17:38.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从老爸那里学来一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One thing I learned from Dad:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.33,0:17:43.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论它是那种变形者一定有种方法可以杀了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No matter what kind of shapeshifter it is, there's one sure way to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:46.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 用银子弹射穿它的心脏 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Silver bullet to the heart. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.33,0:17:50.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:51.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.43,0:17:53.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在扎克家附近 我们查出了点眉目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Near Zach's, checking some things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:56.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请停止 因为我不需要你们的帮助了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam, just stop, because l really...don't need your help anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:17:57.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.93,0:18:00.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉了我的律师 我们去了现场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told the lawyers that we went to the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.23,0:18:02.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:04.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉他们是因为我和警察陪着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I said we were with a policeman...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.23,0:18:05.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们核对了身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}an the chacked it out
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:08.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说根本就没有叫迪恩·温彻斯特的警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and they told me that there is no detective Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.13,0:18:11.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 贝克 - 我不明白你为什么要对我撒那样的谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Beck.  -I don't get why you would lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.23,0:18:14.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们想帮你 - 哦 想帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We're trying to help. - Oh, trying to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.53,0:18:16.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们意识到那是受保护的现场吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you realize that was a sealed crime scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.93,0:18:18.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么做只可能让扎克的案子更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This could have ruined Zach's case.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:19.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝克 我很抱歉 可是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l'm sorry, but
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.53,0:18:21.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见了 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Goodbye, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:37.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不想说 可我早说过会这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hate to say it, but that's exactly what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.13,0:18:40.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对你的朋友撒谎 因为你知道他们了解你后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You lie to your friends because if they knew the real you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:41.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们会害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they'd be freaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.23,0:18:45.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我换作你... 那事情就会简单多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just... It'd be easier if...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.03,0:18:49.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 兄弟 - 这不是象或不象我们不是普通人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- lf I was like you. - Hey, like it or not, we are not like other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.03,0:18:53.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要告诉你一件事这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But l'll tell you one thing, this whole gig...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.73,0:18:56.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要昂首面对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it aingt without perks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.33,0:19:55.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我觉得我们靠近它的巢穴了 - 你为什么那么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Think we're close to its lair. - Why do you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.23,0:19:58.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为在你右边又有一堆黏黏的恶心的脱皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because there's another puke-inducing pile next to your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.33,0:20:00.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 我的天那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.53,0:20:04.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来它住这里有阵子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Looks like it's lived here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.23,0:20:07.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁知道他犯了多少次凶杀案啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who knows how many murders he's gotten away with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:10.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.33,0:20:17.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抓住这个狗娘养的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get the son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:49.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 我们分头追\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, let's split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.25,0:20:50.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 我们在里面汇合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. I'll meet you on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.13,0:21:07.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是吗 - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes. - Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.03,0:21:30.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:35.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 找到了吗 - 不 它溜掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Anything? - No, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:38.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 让我们回到车上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, let's get back to the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.73,0:21:57.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为他找到了另一条下水道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think he found another way underground?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.53,0:22:00.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有可能你有钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, probably. You got the keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.03,0:22:08.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸是不是有次在圣安东尼奥对付过变形者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, didn't Dad once face a shapeshifter in San Antonio?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.73,0:22:10.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是在奥斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, it was Austin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.33,0:22:12.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后来知道那不是变形者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it turned out not to be a shapeshifter. lt was a thought-form.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.13,0:22:16.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那只是思维形式 的一个心境投射 记得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A psychic projection, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.23,0:22:21.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}记得 给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, right.Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.23,0:22:40.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别动哦 你对他做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't move!What have you done with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.53,0:22:43.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兄弟 怎么啦 是我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dude, chill. lt's me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.23,0:22:44.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我不那么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.24,0:22:46.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 把我哥哥弄那里去了 - 你这样会打死他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Where's my brother? - You're about to shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.43,0:22:48.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 萨姆 冷静点 - 你用左手接住钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Calm down. - You caught those keys with your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.93,0:22:50.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的肩膀应该是受了伤的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your shoulder was hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.55,0:22:52.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 可现在好多了你想要我干吗 哭吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, it's better. You want me to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.86,0:22:54.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是我哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're not my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.93,0:22:59.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好啊 那你怎么不开枪 因为你不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why don't you pull the trigger, then.Because you're not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.53,0:23:03.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 兄弟 你了解我的 - 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Dude, you know me. - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.23,0:23:39.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我哥他在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.63,0:23:42.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.13,0:23:45.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我才不担心他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wouldn't worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.93,0:23:49.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我只担心你 - 他在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- l'd worry about you. - Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.43,0:23:53.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实你并不关心这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't really wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.53,0:23:58.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对你们家一清二楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear, the more l learn about your family...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.93,0:24:01.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得我过得并不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought I came from a bad background.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.53,0:24:03.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么 你能了解我们的想法吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you mean, learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.03,0:24:27.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他和你之间有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He sure got issues with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.83,0:24:30.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你上了大学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got to go to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.63,0:24:32.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他只能呆在家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He had to stay home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.73,0:24:36.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的意思是我只能呆在家里 和爸爸一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, l had to stay home. With Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.63,0:24:38.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以为我没有自己的梦想吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't think l had dreams of my own?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.63,0:24:40.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但老爸需要我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But Dad needed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.73,0:24:41.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你跑哪里去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where the hell were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.93,0:24:43.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我哥哥在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.88,0:24:45.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就是你的哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l'm your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.13,0:24:49.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看 从我内心深处…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See, deep down,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.63,0:24:51.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很嫉妒你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l'm just jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.13,0:24:54.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有朋友 有你自己的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got friends. You could have a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.13,0:24:59.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我 我只知道我自己是个怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Me? l know I'm a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.83,0:25:02.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的人迟早都会离开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And sooner or later, everybody's gonna leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.73,0:25:08.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你在说什么 - 你离开了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What are you talking about? - You left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.03,0:25:10.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸托付我每件事我都尽力完成 可他还是弃我而去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hell, I did everything Dad asked me to, and he ditched me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.93,0:25:13.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有任何解释 什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No explanation, nothing. Just:
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.93,0:25:18.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离开了我 让我和你这混蛋在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Left me with your sorry ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.93,0:25:24.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But still, this life...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.63,0:25:28.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}终会有转机的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's not without its perks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.53,0:25:30.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我遇到了很漂亮诱人的美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I meet the nicest people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.03,0:25:36.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就象小贝基 你知道的 迪恩如果有机会一定会泡她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like little Becky. You know Dean would bang her if he had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.53,0:25:40.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们看看会发生什么吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.00,0:25:54.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嗨 - 我知道你要说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Oh, hi. - l know what you're gonna say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.10,0:25:56.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 哦 是吗 - 也不一定很准确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Oh, you do? - Well, no, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.50,0:25:58.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但让我猜猜看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But l can take a guess:
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.41,0:26:00.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我滚蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Get off my porch"?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.40,0:26:03.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 我会那么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.70,0:26:07.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我承认 我们撒谎了 我想我要来解释一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I admit it, we lied.Thought l'd try to explain myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.50,0:26:09.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆叫我别来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam told me not to come, but I thought:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.20,0:26:13.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我想还是该来试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"What the hell? I have to try."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.20,0:26:19.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.80,0:26:27.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你最好是萨姆 而不是那个怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That better be you, Sam, and not that freak of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.80,0:26:32.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我 他以你的样子去瑞贝卡的家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, it's me. He went to Rebecca's, looking like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.40,0:26:34.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来他还不笨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, he's not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.00,0:26:37.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他选了个比较帅的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He picked the handsome one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.40,0:26:44.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你是说有这样的怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you're saying that there's something out there
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.60,0:26:47.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他变成我哥哥的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that made itself look like my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.10,0:26:48.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.80,0:26:52.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你怎么称呼它来着 - 变形者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What did you call it? - A shapeshifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.90,0:26:55.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 也许我们疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. Maybe we're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.10,0:26:57.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但可能我们是正确的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But what if we're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.00,0:27:01.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你自己也那么说扎克同时在两个地方出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, you said it yourself that Zach was in two places at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.30,0:27:05.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 告诉我这怎么可能发生呢 - 好吧 那么这个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Tell me how that could happen. - Okay, so this thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.00,0:27:08.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可以让自己变成任何人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it can make itself look like anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.00,0:27:09.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.60,0:27:13.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 那它象什么 一个完全的怪物吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, what is it? Like a genetic freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.10,0:27:17.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.60,0:27:22.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能进化中会有突变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Evolution is about mutation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.90,0:27:26.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以也许这个东西以人的形态出生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So maybe this thing was born human...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.60,0:27:28.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但却不是人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.10,0:27:32.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丑恶而且憎恨一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hideous and hated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.30,0:27:36.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到他学会变成某个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until he learned to become someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.80,0:27:42.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, that's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.80,0:27:44.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不只是看上去象你 他就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He didn't just look like you, he was you...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.20,0:27:46.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者说他在变成你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or he was becoming you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.90,0:27:48.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什么意思我不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.19,0:27:51.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就想象他在复制 你的想法和记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's like he was downloading your thoughts and memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.90,0:27:55.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你是指复制思维 - 是的 就象那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You mean like the Vulcan Mind Meld? - Yes, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.40,0:27:58.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这就是为什么 他不杀掉我们的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe that's why he doesn't just kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.50,0:28:03.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他需要我们活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe he needs to keep us alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.02,0:28:07.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 心灵感应 - 手给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- ...for the psychic connection. - Hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.80,0:28:11.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点 我们得离开这 他已经到瑞贝卡的家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. Come on, we gotta go.He's probably at Rebecca's already.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.50,0:28:16.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 我们得找个电话 报警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on. We gotta find a phone, call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.60,0:28:20.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喔 喔 你想让我上通缉令吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whoa, whoa, whoa.You're gonna put an APB out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.60,0:28:23.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 往这边走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sorry.This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.10,0:28:31.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这很有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's funny.
