Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.30,0:39:58.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}针对艾米丽的凶杀案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for Emily's murder.
