Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.70,0:40:29.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真希望事情不是这样 我希望你真的是一个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I really wish things could be different.I wish you could just be...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.93,0:40:33.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大学生 - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Joe College. - lt's okay.
