Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.98,0:40:42.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 谢谢 其实我也是个变态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, thanks. Well, l'm a freak too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.22,0:40:44.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会和你一直同路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm right there with you all the way.
